  "title": "· Louis Vuitton Speedy Trunk 25 ·",
  "original_title": "Louis Vuitton Speedy Trunk 25 手袋",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton's Speedy Trunk 25 blends a Boston bag silhouette with trunk-inspired metal corners and elegant arched handles.",
