    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Louis Vuitton Speedy Trunk 25 masterfully merges the practical Boston bag silhouette of the Speedy with the metal corner guards of a classic trunk. Crafted from two-tone Monogram canvas, it builds an architectural profile, while the arched handles inject an elegant grace — a true meeting of classical aesthetics and modern form.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
