    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "First unveiled in Louis Vuitton’s 2025 Pre-Fall women’s collection, the Speedy Trunk is the newest member of the brand’s trunk family. It cleverly fuses the Boston bag shape with traditional trunk-making, adding metal corner guards and rivets as decorative details that reimagine a classic design through a contemporary lens. Initially offered only in a 20 cm mini size, the Speedy Trunk 25 is a new size introduced for the Fall-Winter 2025 season, offering upgraded capacity.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
