    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Structurally, the Speedy Trunk retains the classic Boston bag shape of the Speedy. The Speedy leather travel bag was born in 1930, designed by Gaston-Louis Vuitton, the founder’s grandson. Originally called the “Express” travel bag, it was inspired by the era’s fascination with speed and automobiles. Based on the Keepall travel bag, it was scaled down to a more compact, everyday carryall that could be flattened and stored inside a suitcase.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In 1959, the Speedy was reissued in Monogram canvas, catching the eye of style icons like Audrey Hepburn. In 1965, Louis Vuitton custom-made a smaller Speedy 25 for Hepburn to complement her petite frame. With its timeless look, practical nature, and accessible price point, the Speedy has remained one of Louis Vuitton’s most iconic and best-selling it bags for nearly a century.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/dfc9c56c457da701.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/31a8a3124382ea7c.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Audrey Hepburn with the Speedy 25 handbag, 1960s",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Trunk Inspiration ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The metal corner guards and rivets are the Speedy Trunk’s defining design features, inspired by the brand’s archival trunk-making craftsmanship. The “softened” body material is a modern variation of the hard trunk, giving the bag a more relaxed, approachable look.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/6c63eaf26f50c5b8.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/7178a8c990e3de69.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
