    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/07c186de2aa99e23.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/73f4574cf20245cb.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The trunk not only represents LV’s finest craftsmanship but also serves as an endless well of inspiration for the brand’s modern bags. In 1858, Louis Vuitton introduced the world’s first flat-topped trunk, using lightweight, durable waterproof canvas as the outer layer and poplar wood for the frame, making it easy to stack and transport — a hit among travelers.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/8f338501dc2d756d.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/8f338501dc2d756d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "All the hardware elements on the bag draw from archival trunk designs — metal corner guards and neatly aligned round rivets reinforce and decorate, infusing the bag with a classical touch.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/233ea2947776ac3d.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/4111a43a32ffd5fa.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/29ee1f35fbcbf328.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/a4b9b8b09112ea19.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/68b79f4b5ba25729.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/8b8443428ef6ce77.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The lightweight, soft construction adds a casual, practical dimension. Inside, there’s no rigid wooden panel; instead, the canvas’s own tension holds the three-dimensional shape, giving it an edge over traditional trunks in both weight and capacity.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
