    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Two-Tone Monogram Canvas ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag features a brown Monogram canvas body with Monogram Reverse canvas side panels — a two-tone design that feels younger and more playful.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Zoom in for a super-clear visual experience",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/becf538624fcc9b0.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/257f33cd428a91cc.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/e2f80282e795cdf4.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/d6acf757694ad9a7.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/01fc814d937fc3fd.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/01fc814d937fc3fd.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LV’s most iconic and recognizable Monogram coated canvas was originally the fabric covering the wooden surface of travel trunks. Its advantages: lightweight, durable, water-resistant, and self-supporting.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The monogram pattern dates back to 1896, created as a canvas design for trunks and still used today. Inspired by Victorian-era Japanese “mon” crests, it combines the LV initials with four-petal flowers.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/7dc93b8b4401da27.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/1t2fr6g/61b3c41c0af86d8d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Removable Strap ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag comes with two leather top handles and a removable shoulder strap, allowing it to be carried by hand or worn crossbody. The arched handles echo the curved top line of the Boston bag, evoking the elegant, romantic arches found in architecture. The tubular handles, padded with black calfskin, are rounded and springy, remaining comfortable even after long hours of carrying.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
