    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "With dimensions of 20 x 15 x 27 cm, the bag easily fits a standard smartphone, wallet, and more. We packed it with an iPad mini, notebook, perfume box, phone, tissues, coin purse, lipstick, and pen — and there was still room to spare. Plenty of space for your daily commute or a short getaway.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
