    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton is a globally renowned luggage and leather goods brand founded in 1854 in Paris by Louis Vuitton. In 1987, it merged with Moët Hennessy to form LVMH, the world’s largest luxury group. Beyond travel trunks and handbags, the brand also ventures into fashion, jewelry, eyewear, shoes, watches, and fragrances. Since 1854 from Paris.",
      "url": null,
